# SizeKit — Product

**Name:** SizeKit  
**Tagline:** Make your files fit.  
**Stack:** React Native + Expo SDK 57 + TypeScript (Android first, iOS-compatible)  
**Promise:** Take any photo/document and make it fit an exact upload requirement.

## Positioning

Not "just another image compressor." Win at exact requirements: under 50/200 KB, exact dimensions, JPG/PNG only, passport/visa/job/university specs.

Prefer requirement-first UX ("US Visa Photo") over raw technical knobs. Keep advanced/custom controls available.

## Philosophy

- Hide compression, EXIF, formats, DPI from users — make sensible defaults.
- Fast, offline, privacy-first: files stay on device.
- Simple primary flow: open → tool/requirement → pick file → process → preview → save/share.

## Current stage: MVP Foundation

Build only: Home → Compress → picker → exact-size compression → preview → save/share → basic presets.

Do not implement V1.1/future features (batch, history, PDF tools, AI, etc.) unless explicitly requested.
